    },
    "fullText": "",
    "fullTextFormats": [],
    "fullTextHtml": "",
    "fullTextTemplate": "",
    "lawCode": "Amd §1199-dd, Pub Auth L",
    "lawSection": "Public Authorities Law",
    "memo": "BILL NUMBER:S5437\n\nTITLE OF BILL:\nAn act to amend the public authorities law, in relation to increasing\nthe membership of the Orange county water authority\n\nPURPOSE:\nTo increase the membership of the Orange county water authority from 5\nmembers to 7 members.\n\nSUMMARY OF PROVISIONS:\nSection 1: Increases the membership of the Authority from five (5) to\nseven (7) members and amends any references to the number three (3) to\nread the number four (4) as such references relate to a quorum or action\nby a favorable vote.\n\nSection 2: Enacting Clause\n\nJUSTIFICATION:\nThis bill was requested by the Orange County Legislature. The County of\nOrange believes it to be necessary, and in the best interests of the\nCounty and its residents, to increase the capacity, expertise and diver-\nsity of the Orange County Water Authority. To meet that necessity, the\nCounty of Orange desires to increase the membership of the Authority\nfrom five (5) to seven (7) members.\n\nLEGISLATIVE HISTORY:\n2010: S.7888-Referred to Rules\n\nFISCAL IMPLICATIONS:\nNone.\n\nLOCAL FISCAL IMPLICATIONS:\nNone.\n\nEFFECTIVE DATE:\nThis act shall take effect immediately.\n\n",
